If you have magic protection then a lot of his attacks will do no damage 
("The missiles bounce off!") If you cancelled him with Magicbabe (I don't 
remember if you can) then he won't be able to do a lot of his special 
attacks. All bosses will sit on the stairs and heal. When they get close 
to death, they sit there longer and heal more and won't move unless you 
physically attack them (which then they are likely to run upstairs). I 
think they can escape upstairs on their own, it's all what RNG decides to 
do. :)

